    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρο-ποίητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made by hand,
			artificial,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοφυής</span>
			(natural), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῆπτρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.195
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.149
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					118c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.3.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τείχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					4.10.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήλοφος, τέλμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.63b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				65c
			</span></i>: freq. in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i> of idols, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Is.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλὸξ χ.</span> a fire
				<i>intentionally kindled,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ
				ταὐτομάτου,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.77
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμός,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτόματος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Arc.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκη, τέχνη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.26
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρό-τως</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.10.12
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ.ὠχύρωτο,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσει,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.8.3
			</span></i>.</div>
